title: Wayfaring Stranger
key: Am
type: song
form: verse/chorus
feel: 4/4, slow
rights: public-domain
notes: Minor key. Numbers are relative to the major scale: b6 = F, b3 = C in Am.
verified: false
break: Slow and spacious. Let notes ring; minor pentatonic over the verse, add the b6 over the chorus.
break.mandolin: Tremolo the melody; switch to chop chords for the second time through.

